      "desc:8": "MIAO's EV tradition begins: the GTSR steam singularity entangler — the SSE — is the factory that turns endless steam into singularity after singularity.\n\nIt is a 24x30x23 steel structure that swallows the highest grade of ordinary steam in its input hatches every second. Heat accumulates as coefficient x 0.005 x x/(x+200,000) per cycle — coefficients 0.5 / 1.0 / 2.0 for ordinary / superheated / supercritical. At 100 percent heat it resets and produces exactly one steam-entangled singularity.\n\nNo power, no coolant, no mercy. And remember: dropped singularities detonate after 5 seconds — bag them, do not decorate with them. Zone 4 runs this chain into an economy; here we only light the fire.",
